  <h1>About</h1>
  <p>This project is citizen-created, and both proposals are drafts.</p>
  <p>The goal is democratic repair, not partisan victory. A better system should be harder to buy, harder to corrupt, harder to lie through, and easier for ordinary people to understand.</p>
  <p>Constructive disagreement is welcome. The point is not to pretend these reforms are easy. The point is to stop pretending the current system is working.</p>
